<%- include("partials/header",{title:"Player Help"}) %>
<main class="terminalHelpPage">
  <header class="terminalPageLead">
    <div><div class="pageEyebrow">SUPPORT://PLAYER DIAGNOSTICS</div><h1>PLAYER<br>HELP.</h1></div>
    <aside class="terminalPageLeadAside"><span>ENTRY POINT / PUBLIC</span><b>4 SUPPORT MODULES</b><span>Launcher · account · recovery · community</span><span>Never share passwords in support requests.</span></aside>
  </header>

  <section class="terminalHelpGrid helpGrid" aria-label="EverLeaf support modules">
    <article class="terminalHelpModule helpCard">
      <span class="pageEyebrow">01 / CLIENT</span><h2>INSTALL & UPDATE</h2><p>Download the launcher into an empty folder and use <strong>Install / Repair Files</strong> for missing or interrupted files. Always start EverLeaf through the launcher.</p><a class="btn" href="/downloads">OPEN CLIENT TERMINAL</a>
    </article>
    <article class="terminalHelpModule helpCard">
      <span class="pageEyebrow">02 / ACCOUNT</span><h2>LOGIN STATE</h2><p>Your website and game use the same account. Sign in here to verify the account works and review your character roster before troubleshooting the client.</p><a class="btn" href="/account">OPEN ACCOUNT</a>
    </article>
    <article class="terminalHelpModule helpCard">
      <span class="pageEyebrow">03 / RECOVERY</span><h2>RESTORE ACCESS</h2><p>Submit a privacy-safe recovery request using your username or account email. Staff verifies ownership before changing account access.</p><a class="btn" href="/recover">START RECOVERY</a>
    </article>
    <article class="terminalHelpModule helpCard">
      <span class="pageEyebrow">04 / COMMUNITY</span><h2>CONTACT STAFF</h2><p>Use EverLeaf Discord for direct staff/community help. Never post passwords, private recovery information, or account secrets.</p><% if(brand.discordUrl){ %><a class="btn primary" href="<%=brand.discordUrl%>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OPEN DISCORD</a><% } else { %><a class="btn primary" href="/community">OPEN COMMUNITY</a><% } %>
    </article>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include("partials/footer") %>
